  "description": "BATTERY 630WH + 180Wh (XPro)\n\nOne of the most important features of Core e-bikes is their 150 km range, thanks to the large capacity of their 630 Wh hidden battery, which has energy density of more than 234 Wh/kg.\n\nBATTERY = 630Wh + 180Wh (XPro) = 810Wh TOTAL AUTONOMY (with XPro) = 190Km\n\nBHZ BY SEG AUTOMOTIVE\n\nExperience the power of the BHZ motor by SEG, which at only 2.1 kg transforms your pedaling into speed and energy. With a maximum torque of 65 Nm and a nominal power of 250 W, reaching up to 500 W, this motor is designed to deliver exceptional performance. It only weights 2.2 kg and enables the use of conventional double-plate groupsets. And it does not generate any friction in non-assistance mode, allowing the user to use it at speeds above 25 km/h without any additional effort. Experience the power of the BHZ motor by SEG, which at only 2.1 kg transforms your pedaling into speed and energy. With a maximum torque of 65 Nm and a nominal power of 250 W, reaching up to 500 W, this motor is designed to deliver exceptional performance.\n\nLIGHTNESS\n\nSo lightweight that you won´t believe that it´s an ebike.\n\nX DISPLAY\n\nIts X Display and X Remote are located in the area inside the handlebars for maximum protection.",
